# src/

Rust utility library for OAuth2 client management and secret handling, with primary integration for ORY Hydra. Provides functions to bind file-sourced secrets, retrieve Hydra endpoint URLs, and upsert OAuth2 clients with automatic conflict handling.

## Files

- `lib.rs` -- Public API for secret binding, Hydra URL resolution, and OAuth2 client registration/upsert logic
